  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2301.13 Mailing address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2301.13 \"Mailing address\" means specification of the location where a manufacturer, dealer, or applicant receives properly addressed mail via the U.S. postal service.\n\nSource. #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
